exports[`pretooluse.forbid-shouted-readme.sh given: [case8] block message snapshot when: [t0] Write to root README.md then: Write block message matches snapshot 1`] = `
"
🛑 BLOCKED: Write to README.md

this repo uses readme.md (lowercase) — README.md does not belong here.

  use: readme.md

why: shouted filenames (README.md) violate rule.forbid.shouted-readme.
     one canonical readme per directory, always lowercase.

"
`;

